           asset (docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-27-landing-media-inventory.md — roof
           light box reads as Bangkok taxi signage). service-charter-hero.webp is a
           dusk expressway shot already in the approved asset set; while it doesn't
           show a person/desk the way "corporate & executive" implies, it reads as a
           clean, professional highway transfer with no banned elements — a safer fit
           than parallax/close (a tight product/interior detail shot with no road or
           driving context at all for this slide). -->
      <img class="svc-img" data-svc="3" src="/images/service-charter-hero.webp" alt="">
